## 1. Checklist for Testing Video Functionality

### Mobile App: Video Recording
- [ ] Verify video recording starts and stops as expected.
- [ ] Check video is saved to device storage after recording.
- [ ] Test video quality and resolution settings.
- [ ] Ensure audio is recorded (if applicable) and synchronized.
- [ ] Validate behavior when storage is full.
- [ ] Test recording with different device orientations.
- [ ] Confirm app does not crash during extended recording.

### Mobile App: Video Upload
- [ ] Upload video successfully to the web service.
- [ ] Verify upload progress indicator is displayed.
- [ ] Test upload with valid and invalid network conditions (Wi-Fi, mobile data, no connection).
- [ ] Confirm error handling for failed uploads (retry, notification).
- [ ] Check that uploaded video appears on the web service.
- [ ] Validate upload of large files and edge cases (max file size).

### Web Service: Video Name Editing
- [ ] Edit video name in text field and save changes.
- [ ] Cancel editing without saving changes.
- [ ] Validate input restrictions (max length, special characters).
- [ ] Ensure edited name persists after page refresh.
- [ ] Check for error messages on invalid input.
- [ ] Confirm UI updates immediately after save.

